{"4452200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No One Leaves Lindenfield", "steam_appid": 4452200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5109430], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/de1132e5a43d0e35cc1e76313c67776f.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Leaves Lindenfield</strong> is a first-person stealth horror about breaking into your neighbor’s house to uncover what happened to your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend disappeared in the isolated town of Lindenfield, and the only clues lead to your neighbor’s house. To uncover the truth — and escape the town — you must sneak inside, explore locked rooms, solve environmental puzzles, and avoid the man watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He observes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide too often, and he starts checking the same spots.<br>Use distractions, and he begins using them against you.<br>Act aggressively, and he responds the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you rely on a strategy, the more dangerous it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action teaches him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/d1f9b9c0ad8619fd04692676b43ce29f.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/44217105968178dae564dd77444de3b8.poster.avif?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/44217105968178dae564dd77444de3b8.webm?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/44217105968178dae564dd77444de3b8.mp4?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a human antagonist who mirrors your decisions, learns your habits, and changes his behavior based on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/512d90c2e4739a2c0f4c339851fdd1f1.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/2bc4dcfc84e52ffbd6cc2735a103b0ea.poster.avif?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/2bc4dcfc84e52ffbd6cc2735a103b0ea.webm?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/2bc4dcfc84e52ffbd6cc2735a103b0ea.mp4?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide, distract, sneak through rooms, and use the environment to avoid detection and survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/7506ca5d74da915e1ec3a856b5d6799c.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/91a305c65f2d1d208e5f46ed524924e6.poster.avif?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/91a305c65f2d1d208e5f46ed524924e6.webm?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/91a305c65f2d1d208e5f46ed524924e6.mp4?t=1787336649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden areas, search for clues, and solve exploration-based challenges to progress deeper into the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/66c7cdc946b5f09dbdca5ea464342c42.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/de1132e5a43d0e35cc1e76313c67776f.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Leaves Lindenfield</strong> is a first-person stealth horror about breaking into your neighbor’s house to uncover what happened to your missing friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend disappeared in the isolated town of Lindenfield, and the only clues lead to your neighbor’s house. To uncover the truth — and escape the town — you must sneak inside, explore locked rooms, solve environmental puzzles, and avoid the man watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He observes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide too often, and he starts checking the same spots.<br>Use distractions, and he begins using them against you.<br>Act aggressively, and he responds the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you rely on a strategy, the more dangerous it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action teaches him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452200/extras/d1f9b9c0ad8619fd04692676b43ce29f.webp?t=1787336649\" width=616 height=51 /